        <ExplanationTxt>THE FORM 990 IS PREPARED BY AN OUTSIDE CPA FIRM, REVIEWED AND APPROVED BY THE ORGANIZATION'S PRESIDENT/CEO AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER AND PROVIDED TO THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS FOR REVIEW PRIOR TO THE FILING.</ExplanationTxt>
